  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Jia Fu names Belief Gu when he continues a Ren Zu stretch after Rules and Regulation Gu have given Ren Zu strength and cost him wisdom. Ren Zu will not free the leftover Gu in the net, so they bet that once the net opens they will flee in three directions, and that only the Gu he captures will submit. Jia Fu’s aide guesses Ren Zu captures Attitude Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          59
